Canonical key: for idempotency, sort ops by (kind, cargoID, target) and join with some separator. Since IDs can contain any characters (trimmed but could contain e.g. '|'), use a length-prefixed encoding or use JSON. JSON marshal of sorted ops is easy:

```go
func canonicalKey(ops []Op) string {
    sorted := make([]Op, len(ops))
    copy(sorted, ops)
    sort.Slice(sorted, func(i, j int) bool {
        if sorted[i].Kind != sorted[j].Kind { return sorted[i].Kind < sorted[j].Kind }
        if sorted[i].CargoID != sorted[j].CargoID { return sorted[i].CargoID < sorted[j].CargoID }
        return sorted[i].Target < sorted[j].Target
    })
    b, _ := json.Marshal(sorted)
    return string(b)
}
```

